====22nd====
*As [[Xu Shang-Chi]] is trained by [[Death Dealer]], he repeatedly punches a wooden pole, which has been indented by the years of punching, with little to no pain.{{Ref|SCatLotTR}}<ref name="Training Montage 2014">In ''[[Shang-Chi and the Legend of the Ten Rings]]'', Xu Shang-Chi is shown continuing his training in a time leading up to when he was "fourteen" and sent to kill the Iron Gang Leader on April 27, 2014 (see other references). The several shots prior, including Xu and his sister practicing their rope darts, Xu losing a fight to Death Dealer, and Xu defeating several soldiers, can be taken to be the three days prior. Prior to these scenes, Xu is shown training in the winter, whereas these scenes are in the spring. These seasons would ideally be separated by approximately 90 days, so the winter scenes can be taken to be on January 22-23, 2014.</ref>

