*Raina delivers the Obelisk to [[Calvin Zabo|Skye's father]], who shows her that she can touch it without dying.{{Ref|AoS202}}<ref name="AoS2 Shadows Placement"/>

====9th====
*[[Shane Henson|Shane]] and [[Lori Henson]] move into an apartment in [[Los Angeles]].<ref>In ''[[Devils You Know]]'', [[Rosalind Price]] states that Shane and Lori Henson have lived in their apartment for "the last 18 months" on December 7, 2015 (see [[2015]] references). This can either refer to "exactly 18 months ago," so June 7, 2014, or the more vague "during June 2014." A weighted average, putting more weight on the more specific, would result in the Hensons moving to Los Angeles approximately around June 9, 2014.</ref>{{Ref|AoS304}}
*[[Phil Coulson]] delivers [[Carl Creel]] to [[Glenn Talbot]].{{Ref|AoS202}}<ref name="AoS2 Shadows Placement"/><ref name="AoS2 Stretching">''[[Shadows]]'' and ''[[Heavy Is the Head]]'' occur in June 2014 (see other references), but ''[[A Fractured House]]'' has to take place no earlier than March 2015 (see [[2015]] references). There are undetermined spans of time between ''Heavy is the Head'' and ''[[Making Friends and Influencing People]]'', ''Making Friends and Influencing People'' and ''[[Face My Enemy]]'', and a mostly undetermined span between ''[[A Hen in the Wolf House]]'' and ''A Fractured House'' other than that when ''A Fractured House'' picks up, it does not seem that Morse and Hunter have been reunited for long. A weighted distribution of these episodes' events places 107 days between the events of ''Heavy is the Head'' and ''Making Friends and Influencing People'', a further 107 days between ''Making Friends and Influencing People'' and ''Face My Enemy'', and 53 days between ''A Hen in the Wolf House'' and ''A Fractured House'' to stretch the first set of episodes to fill out the span of time reasonably. This finally places ''Making Friends and Influencing People'' on September 24-26, 2014 and ''Face My Enemy'' and ''A Hen in the Wolf House'' from January 11-14, 2015. This fits well with a statement from Brett Dalton, [https://tvline.com/casting-news/agents-of-shield-skye-ward-shooting-spoilers-580061/ <nowiki>saying, "Ward had a hell of a time in the cage by himself for 6 months [until] he makes a promise; to reunite Skye with her dad,"</nowiki>] which refers to the events of ''Making Friends and Influencing People''. With that episode being September 2014, this works nicely as 6 months after March 2014.</ref>
*Outraged at the peace treaty, [[Ronan the Accuser]] joins [[Thanos]] in an allyship.{{Ref|GotG}}<ref name="GotG Treaty/Massacre Placement"/>
*'''[[Duel on Dervani]]''': [[File:Nebula vs Gamora Comic.jpeg|thumb|250px|[[Gamora]] vs. [[Nebula]]]] Now training [[Thanos]]' children, [[Ronan the Accuser]] sends [[Gamora]] and [[Nebula]] to [[Dervani]] as training exercise to retrieve the [[Data Ingot]]. There, the two sisters fight to get the ingot first and Gamora falls off of a ledge. Gamora appeals to Nebula to help her up, which Nebula does. However, Gamora betrays her sister and throws her off of the cliff. Nebula awakes in a [[Healing Tank]] where Thanos replaces her injured body parts with metal.{{Ref|GotGP1}}{{Ref|GuardiansPrelude}}

