*[[File:15.jpg|thumb|250px|Star-Lord arrives on [[Morag]] to retrieve the [[Orb]]]]In an attempt to separate from the Ravagers, Peter Quill, known as "[[Star-Lord]]", travels alone to Morag to retrieve the [[Orb]].{{Ref|GotG}}{{Ref|Guardians2014Placements}}
*Quill starts up his [[Star-Lord's Walkman|Walkman]], playing "{{WPS|Come and Get Your Love}}" by [[Redbone]] to entertain himself as he goes to get the Orb. He starts to groove to the song as it begins.{{Ref|GotG}}{{Ref|Guardians2014Placements}}
*As the lyrics kick in, Quill kicks his leg up in the air, starting to dance. Getting to a puddle, Quill kicks the water and spins as he passes through it, then continues shuffling along. Quill encounters some [[Orlonis|Orloni]] and kicks them aside in time to the music.{{Ref|GotG}}{{Ref|Guardians2014Placements}}
