*[[File:Orloni4.png|thumb|250px|Quill finds another Orloni]]As Quill reaches the second verse, he again grabs an Orloni and pretends it is a microphone, singing to it.{{Ref|GotG}}{{Ref|Guardians2014Placements}}
*Quill struts along and spins around, before slowing down. As he continues walking, he comes across a [[Korbinites|Korbinite]] skeleton.{{Ref|GotG}}{{Ref|Guardians2014Placements}}
*Quill grabs another Orloni, singing the second chorus to it as he keeps going. Getting to another slippery patch, Quill simply slides across once again.{{Ref|GotG}}{{Ref|Guardians2014Placements}}
