*[[File:GotG T2 7.png|thumb|250px|Quill fights off Korath and his [[Sakaarans]]]]'''[[Battle of Morag]]''': Quill uses a [[Gravity Mine]] to draw the Orb out of its field, and is successful. At that moment, Korath and his soldiers break in. Korath asks how he knows about it, but Quill claims to just be a junker looking around. When Korath makes off with the Orb, Quill breaks the Plasma Sphere, which disintegrates the soldiers. He then shoots Korath with his [[Quad Blasters]] and picks up the Orb when the [[Kree]] drops it. Korath shoots at him but he dodges.{{Ref|GotG}}{{Ref|Guardians2014Placements}}
