*Quill slides into the ''[[Milano]]'' cockpit as the Sakaarans free themselves from the Gravity Mine and prepare to stop him. Korath leads them in preparing a cannon, then starts firing as Quill pilots the ship away, dodging the blasts.{{Ref|GotG}}{{Ref|Guardians2014Placements}}
