*[[File:Bereet1-GOTG.png|thumb|250px|Bereet inside the ''[[Milano]]'']]A [[Krylorian]] woman named [[Bereet]], who Quill has just started dating, emerges from the ship's hold, asking what happened. Quill admits he had forgotten she was on-board.{{Ref|GotG}}{{Ref|Guardians2014Placements}}
