*At school, a group of kids start making racist comments toward [[Xu Shang-Chi]], who is using the alias "Shaun." A student calls him "{{WPS|Gangnam Style}}," and "Shaun" replies that he is not [[Korea]]n, calling the student an idiot. [[Katy Chen]] sees the student drop his backpack and prepare to punch "Shaun." However, before he can, Chen starts screaming the lyrics to "{{WPS|Hotel California}}" and steals the bully's car keys.{{Ref|SCatLotTR}}<ref name="SC/Katy Meet">In ''[[Shang-Chi and the Legend of the Ten Rings]]'', Katy Chen says to Xu Shang-Chi, "we've been friends for ten years." Xu later explains that they met when he "had just moved to the U.S." and "was struggling with my English." With Xu moving to the United States on April 28, 2014 (see other references), this can be taken to have happened early into the 2014-2015 school year. Xu went to high school in Los Angeles, where [https://mommypoppins.com/kids/2014-15-academic-year-calendars-for-la-area-schools schools tended to start around August 21, 2014 on average]. It can therefore be taken that Xu and Chen met at this time.</ref>
*Chen pulls "Shaun" into the parking lot, revealing that she had stolen the keys. They and [[Soo]] go for a joyride near their school.{{Ref|SCatLotTR}}<ref name="SC/Katy Meet"/>

====26th====
*[[Groot]], newly replanted after his death during the [[Battle of Xandar]] sleeps in his pot in the ''[[Milano]]''. He wakes up and yawns as he stretches.{{Ref|IAG101}}<ref name="IAG101 Placement">In ''[[Groot's First Steps]]'', Groot is shown growing to the size he will be in ''[[Guardians of the Galaxy Vol. 2]]''. Based on his size at the end of ''[[Guardians of the Galaxy (film)|Guardians of the Galaxy]]'' and his growth throughout the short, it can be taken that the main events of the short are set on September 8, 2014. Furthermore, the introductory montage can be placed in the two months leading up to it, tracking Groot's growth rate.</ref>

