*[[Gamora]], [[Drax]], and [[Star-Lord]] leave with [[Ego]] and [[Mantis]] to Ego's planet. Rocket and [[Groot]] remain to repair the Milano and guard [[Nebula]].{{Ref|GotGV2}}{{Ref|Guardians2014Placements}}
