**[[File:GOTG2 Art of VFX 4.png|thumb|250px|Rocket attacks the [[Yondu Ravager Clan|Ravagers]]]]Rocket enjoys setting off several traps for them, taking down numerous Ravagers, but he is forced to give in when [[Yondu Udonta]] arrives and threatens him with his [[Yaka Arrow]]. However, when Yondu shows reluctance to turn Quill over to the Sovereign, some of the group question whether he is being too soft, and Ravager [[Taserface]] uses the opportunity to lead a mutiny against him.{{Ref|GotGV2}}{{Ref|Guardians2014Placements}}
