*'''[[Attack on Gamora]]''':
**[[Nebula]] arrives at Ego's planet in the ship from the Ravagers and tries to kill Gamora. Gamora fights back, and the two of them end up fighting in the caverns beneath the planet's surface. Gamora gets the upper hand, but lets her sister live.{{Ref|GotGV2}}{{Ref|Guardians2014Placements}}
