*[[Ego]] and [[Peter Quill]] bond over the song "{{WPS|Brandy (You're a Fine Girl)}}" by [[Looking Glass]]. Ego then tells Quill that he wants to show him something.{{Ref|GotGV2}}{{Ref|Guardians2014Placements}}
*[[Mantis]] wakes [[Drax]], desperate to warn him about Ego before it is too late, Drax, misreads the situation, and rejects what he belived to be Mantis' advances. Mantis clarifies and tells Drax about all of Ego's children{{Ref|GotGV2}}{{Ref|Guardians2014Placements}}
