**The lava inches closer to the seed, as Groot puts on a little puppet show. Watcher watches, growing stressed as Groot takes a quick nap. Sunlight from outside wakes Groot up, and he makes his way to the seed, only to collect his bouncy ball, which had been launched onto the seed. Watcher panics as the seed is engulfed by the lava and the temple begins to crumble.{{Ref|IAG205}}{{Ref|Guardians2014Placements}}
