*[[File:John-Healy-Suicide-Blood.jpg|thumb|250px|[[John Healy]] kills himself]]'''[[Attack on John Healy]]''': Healy, now free, is attacked by the masked man, who interrogates him and forces him to give up the name of his employer; [[Wilson Fisk]]. Distraught that he had given up Fisk's name, Healy kills himself by impaling his head on a piece of metal.{{Ref|DD103}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/> 
