*[[File:Anatoly Ranskahov-head-crushed.jpg|thumb|250px|[[Anatoly Ranskahov]] is murdered by [[Wilson Fisk]]]]'''[[Murder of Anatoly Ranskahov]]''': In the car, Wesley questions Anatoly on the situation with the man in the mask. He adds that he wishes to continue his work with Fisk, however, when the car stops, Fisk rips the door open and throws Anatoly to the ground, before slamming the car door into his head repeatedly, decapitating him. Fisk orders Wesley to send the body to Vladimir, and make it appear as if the masked man had killed him.{{Ref|DD104}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
