*[[File:Corbin-threatens-Daredevil.jpg|thumb|250px|Officer [[Corbin]] threatens the Masked man]]'''[[Chase of Vladimir Ranskahov]]''':
**<!---21:00 EST--->Ranskahov and Sergei are attacked by the masked man, but are stopped by the [[NYPD]].{{Ref|DD105}} The corrupt NYPD officers attempt to arrest Murdock, and kill Ranskahov, but Murdock escapes and fight the offers, during the scuffle, Ranskahov is hit by one of the officers. Murdock and Ranskahov are able to escape, but Sergei is killed by the officers.{{Ref|DD106}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
**At the [[New York Bulletin Building]], [[Ben Urich]] looks over his evidence in the Fisk case, but is interrupted by the new of the bombings. Urich notices that the buildings all belonged to the Russians.{{Ref|DD106}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
