**[[Christian Blake]] and [[Carl Hoffman]] search the Russian hideout for survivors, finding [[Ivan]], who they kill, ordering their men to do the same.{{Ref|DD106}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
**Murdock carries Ranskahov into an [[Abandoned Building]] and assess his injuries, and corrects Ranskahov, telling him he never killed Anatoly, and that it was Fisk.{{Ref|DD106}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
**[[File:Condemned Thumbnail.jpg|thumb|250px|Murdock tries to save [[Vladimir Ranskahov]]]]Nelson and Page bring Cardenas to [[Metro-General Hospital]], and she is treated by [[Claire Temple]]. Temple gets a call from Murdock, asking her to walk him through saving Ranskahov's life. Begrudgingly she agrees and instructs him on how to use a flare to cauterize his wound. Ranskahov's screams are heard by officer [[Sullivan (NYPD)|Sullivan]] outside, who follows the source of the sound. Murdock senses this and investigates.{{Ref|DD106}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
