**The press arrive on the scene, given info on the story by Wesley. Page sees the live broadcast and tries to contact Murdock. She and Nelson are worried when they don't get a reply.{{Ref|DD106}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
**Murdock regains consciousness, and feels that Ranskahov's heart has stopped, but he preforms CPR and saves him.{{Ref|DD106}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
**[[File:CHoffmanBUrichHelpingCBlake.png|thumb|250px|[[Christian Blake]] is gunned down]]Wesley arranges for Fisk to have a walkie-talkie connection to Sullivan as a corrupt {{WPS|Emergency Service Unit}} arrive.{{Ref|DD106}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
