**The officers find Sullivan and kill him.{{Ref|DD106}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
**[[File:Masked Man with Vladimir.jpg|thumb|250px|Ranskahov protects the Masked Man in his final moments]]Murdock and Ranskahov head into the sewer, but are pursued by the police. Murdock protects Ranskahov and fights off the officers. Ranskahov stays on the ground, and decides to die fighting, believing there is no way for him to stop Fisk or make it out alive. He reveals that [[Leland Owlsley]] is in charge of all of Fisk's holdings and money. Ranskahov makes his final stand shoots at the officers as Murdock makes his escape.{{Ref|DD106}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
