*[[Foggy Nelson]], [[Karen Page]], and [[Matt Murdock]] discuss the events of the last couple days, with Nelson voicing his distain for the Masked Man. Murdock and Page attempt to calm Nelson down, knowing the paper is using speculation. Murdock says goodnight to Page and Nelson, as he stays to work on [[Elena Cardenas]]' case.{{Ref|DD107}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
*[[Leland Owlsley]] meets with [[Nobu Yoshioka]] and informs him that his share of the Russian's holdings have been transferred, and tries to pry Yoshioka's plans, but to no avail. Once Nobu leaves, the [[Masked Man]] interrogates Owlsley, but Owlsley simply tases him and leaves. [[Stick]] arrives and belittles Murdock for his failure.{{Ref|DD107}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
