*That night, Fisk calls Vanessa to tell her goodnight, but is interrupted by Wesley informing him of [[Christian Blake]] regaining conciseness at the hospital. Fisk orders Wesley to schedule a meeting between he and [[Carl Hoffman]].{{Ref|DD108}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
