*[[File:CBlakeDeathScene.png|thumb|250px|[[Carl Hoffman]] poisons [[Christian Blake]]]]'''[[Assassination of Christian Blake]]''': Saddened by what he must do, Hoffman arrives at [[Metro-General Hospital]] and administers a fast-acting poison to kill Blake, but moments before he dies, the [[Masked Man]] arrives and asks Blake for information. Wanting to get back at Fisk for his betrayal, Blake shares all that he knows before dying.{{Ref|DD108}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
*[[Leland Owlsley]] and Fisk meet with [[Melvin Potter]], who fits them with new protective suits. Wesley informs the duo of Blake's death and the Masked man's interference.{{Ref|DD108}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>

===December===
*[[Samantha Reyes]] is honored by The New York Trial Lawyers Association. ''"Awarded On Behalf Of The Board And Membership In Recognition And Appreciation Of Her Service To The Profession"''<ref>[https://www.ebay.com/itm/294271324170?hash=item4483f0100a:g:3CMAAOSw-o9gbR~z Sreen used throphy]</ref>
