*As they watch his empire fall apart, Fisk orders for [[Vanessa Marianna]] to be moved to [[Europe]].{{Ref|DD113}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
*'''[[Arrest of Wilson Fisk]]''': The FBI storm into [[Wilson Fisk's Penthouse]] and arrest him, as he gives Marianna a ring as a final gift. He expresses his love for her as he is dragged away. Downstairs, Fisk is placed into the FBI convoy as he ignores the press' questions.{{Ref|DD113}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
*At the office, Nelson, Murdock, and Page celebrate the news of Fisk's arrest, proud of what they have all done. They toast to [[Elena Cardenas]], [[Ben Urich]], and everyone else Fisk has hurt.{{Ref|DD113}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
*[[File:Wilson-Fisk-Armed-Guard.jpg|thumb|250px|[[Wilson Fisk]] admits that he is the ill intent]]In the police van, Fisk recounts the {{WPS|Parable of the Good Samaritan}}, stating that he is no longer the good Samaritan, but rather the ill intent. As the convoy reaches a bridge, they are ambushed by dozens of Fisk's corrupt [[NYPD]] officers, leading to a shootout in the street. Fisk remains calm as his officers decimate the FBI.{{Ref|DD113}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
*Nelson, Murdock, and Page watch the news in horror as Fisk's convoy is attack, before suggesting they head home before the streets are closed down. They send Page home in a cab, despite her insistence on them coming with her. Nelson asks Murdock to stay safe, and not die while stopping Fisk before heading home.{{Ref|DD113}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
*The officers reach Fisk's van and free him. Fisk is then escorted into an unmarked truck, and transported to a secure location.{{Ref|DD113}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
*[[File:Daredevil-vs-Kingpin-alley-fight-1-.jpg|thumb|250px|[[Daredevil]] faces  Wilson Fisk]]Murdock meets with [[Melvin Potter]], who introduced him to the [[Daredevil's Suit|new armored suit]] he requested. Murdock thanks him for the suit, and promises he will protect [[Betsy Beatty]], as promised.{{Ref|DD113}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
*Donning the suit, Murdock listens for Fisk's location, and begins to track him down. He overhears Fisk as he arrives at a garage and is moved into a different truck. Fisk instructs Marianna to leave if he has not joined her in twenty minutes' time, but he assures her that they will be reunited eventually.{{Ref|DD113}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
*'''[[Duel of Hell's Kitchen]]''': 
**Murdock ambushes the truck, causing it to flip over. As Fisk exits, he is face to face with the man in the mask, [[Daredevil]]. Daredevil uses his [[Daredevil's Billy Club|billy clubs]] to fend off Fisk's remaining guards, as Fisk runs away.{{Ref|DD113}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
**[[File:Daredevil about to strike Fisk.jpg|thumb|250px|Daredevil defeats Wilson Fisk]]Daredevil peruses Fisk into an alleyway, cornering him. Fisk berates Daredevil, as he took everything from him, vowing to kill him. The two men charge into battle, and Fisk throws Daredevil onto the ground, but he retaliates with a series of punches and kicks. Fisk grabs Daredevil and slams him into the wall, eventually throwing him down again. Fisk grabs a pipe and swings it at Daredevil, striking his helmet. Daredevil uses his billy clubs to counter Fisk, but is caught off guard, grabbed by Fisk, and pinned to the ground. Fisk grabs the billy club and angrily beats Daredevil with it, screaming that the city doesn't deserve his better tomorrow, however, Daredevil is able to regain control of his club, using it to beat Fisk until he is knocked down.{{Ref|DD113}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
**Mahoney arrives, and realizes that Daredevil is the masked man, and he just stopped Fisk. He reports finding and detaining Fisk, and allows Daredevil to go.{{Ref|DD113}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>
*Marianna is saddened when Fisk misses the window, so she dons the ring before departing, longing to see him again.{{Ref|DD113}}<ref name="DDS1 Nov-Dec 2014 Placement"/>

