====17th====
*[[Wilson Fisk]]'s attorney, [[Benjamin Donovan]], visits Fisk in prison, and warns him that the case was not looking good for him due to the long list of crimes he was being held accountable for.{{Ref|DD209}}<ref name="DD209 Fisk Dates">In ''[[Daredevil (episode)|Daredevil]]'', Fisk is imprisoned on the reasoned date of Tuesday, December 16, 2014 (see other references). In ''[[Seven Minutes in Heaven]]'', flashbacks are shown detailing his time in prison shortly thereafter. In the first scene following Fisk getting his cell, Benjamin Donovan visits Fisk. Since [https://www.libertyfund.nyc/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/2016-Rikers-Island-Visitor-Guide.pdf visitations are not allowed at Rikers Island on Tuesdays], it can be taken that this is the following day, so Wednesday, December 17, 2014, assuming this is a day where last names A-L were allowed visitors. Following this scene, Fisk is confronted by Dutton and meets Stewart Finney during a meal, both of which would've happened shortly after he arrived at the prison, so these can both be taken to be the same day as Donovan's first visit. After this, Donovan visits Fisk a second time. The earliest date this would be possible would be Friday, December 19, 2014, assuming visitations on Thursday, December 18, 2014 were reserved for inmates with last names M-Z, so this scene can be dated to said date.</ref>
*Fisk is visited by another inmate named [[Dutton]]. Dutton tells Fisk that although he may have made a name for himself on the outside, on the inside Dutton is the kingpin of the prison.{{Ref|DD209}}<ref name="DD209 Fisk Dates"/>
*[[File:WilsonFisk-MeetsStewartFinney.jpg|thumb|250px|Fisk is introduced to [[Stewart Finney]]]]Fisk is visited by [[Stewart Finney]], who claims that he wished to meet Fisk as he felt they could help each other. Finney explains to him that Dutton controls about 80% of the contraband running through the prison. Finney presents Fisk with his allies, the violent Valdez brothers, who have a sick mother.{{Ref|DD209}}<ref name="DD209 Fisk Dates"/>

